{"unit_id":"ruaibeite__dsh-auto-observe#caveat-1","repo":"ruaibeite/dsh-auto-observe","commit":"bc0b3cd908017156d0d4d6c00030ff3f994dfc86","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"@ruaibeite/dsh-auto-observe 使用前须知：补记的是文件当前版本，不代表模型看过文件内容；默认关闭整文件覆盖前的自动登记，只有显式启用 writes 才会处理 write intent。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:25-28","lib/index.js:56-63"]}
